# Curaleaf First Page daily edition (brief #5806): every 15 minutes from 07:00 to
# 12:00 CT, stopping once today's edition is published. The UTC hours cover both CDT
# (12-17 UTC) and CST (13-18 UTC); curaleaf-publish.sh drops runs outside the
# Central window and runs after today is published.
*/15 12-18 * * * /app/curaleaf-publish.sh cron >/proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
